Feature: Platform-Aware Curriculum & Contract Landing # tests/features/platform-curriculum.feature:1
  As a user who has chosen a topic
  I want a curriculum that teaches me BOTH the skill AND how to win contracts on my chosen platforms
  So that I can land my first freelance contract faster
  Feature: Platform-Aware Curriculum & Contract Landing  # tests/features/platform-curriculum.feature:1

  Scenario: CG1 — Generate curriculum for a topic without linked platforms  # tests/features/platform-curriculum.feature:10
    Given the curriculum generator API is available                         # tests/steps/test_platform_curriculum.py:17
    And I am a logged-in user                                               # tests/steps/test_platform_curriculum.py:23
    Given I am enrolled in "Web Scraping with Python"                       # tests/steps/test_platform_curriculum.py:30
    And I have NOT linked any freelance platforms                           # tests/steps/test_platform_curriculum.py:35
    When a 30-day curriculum is generated                                   # tests/steps/test_platform_curriculum.py:109
    Then the curriculum should have exactly 30 days                         # tests/steps/test_platform_curriculum.py:176
    And Day 1 should be about HTTP Requests or HTML fundamentals            # tests/steps/test_platform_curriculum.py:188
    And Day 30 should be about job preparation, final project, or portfolio # tests/steps/test_platform_curriculum.py:200
    And there should be NO platform-specific application days               # tests/steps/test_platform_curriculum.py:212

  Scenario: CG2 — Generate curriculum with Upwork linked                       # tests/features/platform-curriculum.feature:19
